## [0.8.0] Negative constraints — verified

| Constraint | Status |
|---|---|
| No support-routing copy ("for account, billing or outage support…") | Absent |
| Hero keeps **both** ZIP checker and call button | Both present |
| Plan/section CTAs say "Call to order" | Enforced by `ctaLabelFor()` |
| Unpriced plans say "Call for pricing" | TV + bundles, automatically |
| Raw phone number as button text only in navbar/footer | Header CTA and footer only |
| No competitor bashing or self-deprecating copy | Absent |
| No sections for services Bluepeak does not sell | Cable/Mobile/Phone omitted at the data layer |
| No "See Bluepeak's official Broadband Facts label" link | Absent |
| No "Pricing observed <date>" strings | Absent |
| No "Is this the official Bluepeak site?" FAQ | Absent |
| `data-call-cta` on every `tel:` link | Enforced centrally |
| Zero horizontal overflow to 320px | Verified |

