## Known follow-ups for the owner

- **Replace the placeholder phone number.** `site.phoneDisplay` /
  `site.phoneHref` in `lib/content.ts` are set to `(888) 555-0142`, a reserved
  fictional number. One edit updates the header, hero, every CTA and the footer.
- `metadataBase` in `app/layout.tsx` is `https://example.com`. Point it at the
  real domain before launch so OG URLs resolve.
- Legal links in the footer are anchors to the disclosure block. Point them at
  real policy pages once those exist.
- Re-audit pricing against mybluepeak.com periodically; the $10-off-for-six-
  months promotion running at build time was scheduled to end 30 Sep 2026 and is
  not represented in the plan data.
